{"id":"ne66193c14f","headline":"Yael Eckstein – Salary and Economy in Israel Take a Big Hit During Iran War","summary":"Following the US and Israeli military operation against Iran that began on February 28, the threat of Iranian missile fire has become a constant risk. The war has taken a big toll on Israel's economy and salaries.","why":"Israel's economy is sensitive to security conditions, which affect its shekel, bond yields and investment flows. Prolonged conflict can weigh on growth and public finances.","category":"economy","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Jerusalem","country":"Israel","lat":31.77,"lon":35.21,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"NorthcentralPA.com","url":"https://www.northcentralpa.com/features/ncpa_media/economy-in-israel-takes-big-hit-during-iran-war/article_8af97944-3fae-48d2-ad1f-525348b2ac7a.html"},"sources":[{"name":"NorthcentralPA.com","url":"https://www.northcentralpa.com/features/ncpa_media/economy-in-israel-takes-big-hit-during-iran-war/article_8af97944-3fae-48d2-ad1f-525348b2ac7a.html"}],"published_at":"2026-09-15T22:53:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"447558b43e73b0e0","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-15T22:53:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-16T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/city-skyline-business-district-4667143.jpg","alt":"city skyline business district (illustration)","credit":"serbuxarev","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/city-street-architecture-busine